# SC-06: 配置 Skill 参数
# 流程图: configure-skill-params.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 用户打开配置界面]) --> OpenSlideOver[打开 SlideOver 侧边抽屉]
    OpenSlideOver --> SwitchConfigTab[切换到 配置 标签页]
    SwitchConfigTab --> GenerateForm[生成动态表单]

    GenerateForm --> LoadCurrentConfig[加载当前配置]
    LoadCurrentConfig --> RenderFields[渲染表单字段]
    RenderFields --> UserModify[用户修改参数]

    UserModify --> ClickSave[点击 保存 按钮]
    ClickSave --> ValidateParams[验证参数格式]
    ValidateParams -->|失败| ShowValidationError[显示错误<br/>参数格式错误]
    ValidateParams -->|成功| SaveToDB[保存到数据库<br/>config JSON 字段]

    ShowValidationError --> UserModify

    SaveToDB --> ClearCache[清理缓存]
    ClearCache --> ShowSuccess[显示保存成功提示]
    ShowSuccess --> End([结束: 配置保存完成])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style End fill:#e1f5e1
    style ShowValidationError fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowSuccess fill:#d1ecf1
